# 🛤️ Deepsmoke Star Development Roadmap

## 🔩 Phase 1 – Solidify the Foundation
- Implement host-authoritative co-op sync for block placement & chest inventories.
- Load and instantiate the custom Blockbench models (steam-hauler, drill turret, goblin mech, etc.).
- Cache and clone models; ensure lighting and shadows work with dynamic weather.
- Basic persistence of chest contents and placed block-models.

## ⚙️ Phase 2 – The World Fights Back
- **Stalactite falls** – crack, drop, damage (with drop shadows).
- **Lava flows & steam vents** – dynamic hazards tied to steam economy.
- **Cave-ins** – structural failure when supports are removed.
- **Dart traps & ancient machinery** – pressure-plate triggered in ruins.
- **Fossil & coal seams** – mineable resources for suit upgrades and lore.
- Sound cues for every hazard (Star Audio SDK).

## 🚂 Phase 3 – Trains, Tracks & Logistics
- Track placement: 2D billboarded rails with drop shadows (performance-friendly).
- Free-form snapping, simple curves, switches.
- Hauler carts – cargo capacity, fuel consumption, train schedules.
- Lever/button controls for automatic camp deliveries.

## 🧰 Phase 4 – Camp, Crafting & Character Upgrades
- NPC trio (Bub, Tub, Grub) drives progression.
- **Bub** – camp expansion UI, new station unlocks.
- **Tub** – drill and mech suit module upgrades (no broken tools).
  - Drill: speed, fuel efficiency, depth, AoE.
  - Suit: armour, steam capacity, hazard resistance, light, Grub summon.
- **Grub** – loyalty path: faster, more carry capacity, air drops.
- **Streamlined crafting**: module-slot system at Tub’s forge. No giant grids or 20 benches.
- Fossils and coal as upgrade materials.

## 🤝 Phase 5 – True Cooperative Mechanics
- Throwable resource cans – aim to share fuel/ore mid-drill.
- Revive & drag downed teammates (Grub can also do it).
- Shared camp inventory (already synced).
- Possible partner-specific abilities (hazard sensing, stronger drilling).

## 🎈 Phase 6 – The Skies
- Craftable hot air balloons, anchored at camp or outposts.
- Wind-based navigation tied to weather system.
- Used for scouting biomes, floating islands, and sightseeing.
- Optional: balloon-to-balloon tethering, cooperative steering.

## 👻 Phase 7 – Ghost Kings & Puzzle Vaults
- Ancient sky-castles house spectral goblin kings (Blockbench models, translucent, regal).
- They offer lore-rich quests (retrieve lost drill core, purify corrupted geode, re-forge Crown Gear).
- Completing quests grants unique upgrade plans for Tub (ghost-metal drill tip, hazard-sensing module, steam charm).
- Each castle seals a **puzzle boss** – no combat, only environmental trials:
  - Crystal Heart (stabilise a pulsing geode with precise drilling and steam redirection).
  - Furnace Bellows (reroute lava flows, dodge steam vents).
  - Mirror Maze (use suit lamps, align light beams, avoid fuel-draining darkness).
- Co-op required for some trials; failure costs resources, not a game over.
- Rewards: high-tier materials, crown pieces, permanent buffs.
- Ghost kings reveal the history of the old goblin civilisation – and the existence of the buried titans.

## ⚙️ Phase 8 – Titans in the Dirt
- Discovery: Ghost King quest unlocks an **Ancient Goblin Lexicon**.
- Bub’s scanning table triangulates signals of colossal buried mechs hidden in extreme biomes.
- Excavation is a multi‑session co‑op puzzle-hazard event:
  - Unstable struts, seeping fuel lines, rust‑spike nests, guardian automatons.
  - One player scans with the Lexicon, the other places braces and drains hazards.
- Restored at camp via Tub’s forge:
  - Each titan yields a unique blueprint in the Titan Codex.
  - Requires rare materials (Titan Bone, Core Crystals, Boiler Glands).
  - Limbs, boiler, drill‑arm and cockpit built as separate projects (each a mini‑hazard quest).
- Piloting: a two‑player vehicle (Pilot + Engineer).
  - Bores 5×5 tunnels, harvests whole veins, resists lava.
  - Fuel‑hungry; requires Grub and logistics to keep it running.
  - Not a combat mech – a terrain‑shaper.
- Titans unlock endgame biomes (Vaults of the Forgotten Sun) and personal suit modules miniaturised from titan technology.
- Progression becomes archaeology: rediscovering lost goblin greatness.
